B.LP=new A.cE("Stranger",B.U7)
B.UI=s(["I was on my way to the docks when I found you. I was sure you were dead...","The doctor has been by to check on you. Your body, he says, will heal, but he cannot explain your memory loss.","Now that you are awake, do you remember anything about what happened to you?"],t.s)
