B.LQ=new A.cE("Mateo",B.UW)
B.SA=s(["Welcome aboard, sailor. I am Captain Lorenzo, and I assign bounties to crews bold enough to earn them.","A bounty is a promise: I name the target, you bring back proof, and the reward is yours.","I have a first contract waiting. Will you accept it?"],t.s)
